    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This beautifully presented, furnished two-bedroom apartment is located in Bloomfield Park, Donnybrook, Dublin 4. Set among landscaped communal gardens with decorative fountains, it offers a calm residential setting within easy reach of Ballsbridge, Dublin city centre, the RDS and Aviva Stadium.\r\n\r\nThe Apartment\r\nThe bright living and dining room features full-height glazing, elegant furnishings and a lovely outlook across the gardens. A well-equipped modern kitchen provides excellent storage and everything needed for comfortable everyday living.\r\n\r\nBedrooms and Bathrooms\r\nThere are two bedrooms and two bathrooms, including an en-suite main bedroom. The principal bedroom has a double bed, while the second bedroom offers flexible space that may also suit use as a home office. Both bathrooms are finished in a clean, contemporary style.\r\n\r\nPrivate Outdoor Space\r\nA private seated garden patio overlooks the landscaped communal grounds, offering a peaceful outdoor space rarely found in such a convenient Dublin 4 location.\r\n\r\nConnectivity and Parking\r\nWi-Fi and entertainment services are provided, subject to current availability. On-site parking is also available.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nBloomfield Park is ideally placed for Donnybrook village, Ballsbridge and the surrounding business districts, with straightforward access to Dublin city centre and public transport connections."
      },
